<title>USA: Metro Networks Q4 shr $0.23 vs. $0.24.</title>
<headline>Metro Networks Q4 shr $0.23 vs. $0.24.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			  3,528		    3,699</p>
<p> Ad revs		   30,160		   21,978</p>
